<Legal
    title="Terms of use"
    description="The terms for using Sikemux, its phone app and Sikemux accounts."
    updated="3 October 2026">
    <p>
        These terms cover the Sikemux app for your computer, the Sikemux phone app, and Sikemux accounts at <a href="https://app.sikemux.com">app.sikemux.com</a>. Sikemux is made by nodelike. By using them you agree to
