        arising from your use of Sikemux.
    </p>

    <h2>Ending</h2>
    <p>
        You can stop using Sikemux at any time, and delete your account as described on <a href="/delete-account">Delete your account</a>. How we handle your data is in the <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>
        If these terms change, the date at the top changes with it. For a change that matters, we will say so in the app
        or on this website before it takes effect.
    </p>
</Legal>
